<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for Wellness Savings (wellnesssavings.org). How we collect, use, share, and protect your information, including Google AdSense cookies, affiliate tracking, and your privacy rights.">
  <div class="container-narrow about-section">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: September 5, 2026</em></p>
    <p>
      Wellness Savings (“<strong>Wellness Savings</strong>,” “<strong>we</strong>,” “<strong>us</strong>,” or “<strong>our</strong>”) operates <a href="https://wellnesssavings.org/">https://wellnesssavings.org</a> (the “<strong>Site</strong>”). This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and protect information when you visit the Site, read our articles, click deal or affiliate links, purchase our digital Wellness Guide, or otherwise interact with us.
    </p>
    <p>
      We publish this policy so it is easy to find from every page of the Site (including via the footer link) and so it meets <strong>Google AdSense</strong> publisher disclosure requirements and common global privacy standards, including the EU/UK GDPR, California CCPA/CPRA, other U.S. state privacy laws, and COPPA.
    </p>
    <p>
      By using the Site, you acknowledge this Privacy Policy. If you do not agree, please do not use the Site. This page is an informational disclosure; it is not legal advice.
    </p>

    <h2>Contents</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="#who-we-are">1. Who we are</a></li>
      <li><a href="#information-we-collect">2. Information we collect</a></li>
      <li><a href="#how-we-use-information">3. How we use information</a></li>
      <li><a href="#cookies">4. Cookies and similar technologies</a></li>
      <li><a href="#adsense">5. Google AdSense and advertising (required disclosures)</a></li>
      <li><a href="#affiliates">6. Affiliate links and referral tracking</a></li>
      <li><a href="#payments">7. Payments</a></li>
      <li><a href="#analytics-hosting">8. Analytics, hosting, and logs</a></li>
      <li><a href="#sharing">9. How we share information</a></li>
      <li><a href="#retention">10. Data retention</a></li>
      <li><a href="#security">11. Security</a></li>
      <li><a href="#international">12. International transfers</a></li>
      <li><a href="#children">13. Children’s privacy</a></li>
      <li><a href="#gdpr">14. Privacy rights (EEA, UK, and Switzerland)</a></li>
